1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Kustaa was born in Savijärvi croft in Vatsola village, Lempäälä, where his father was a crofter. Father Aatami died when Kustaa was only 4 years old. His mother soon remarried. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1854 Kustaa married Anna Wahlsten, Vesilahti-born daughter of a blacksmith.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kustaa was a crofter in a couple of places (Savijärvi, Pyöräkoski) before moving to Vesilahti in 1863, where he was a leaseholder of Tanska farm in Järvenranta village, and from 1869 onwards in a croft called Keihonen in the area 
2 CONC of the same Tanska farm.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1878 the family moved back to Lempäälä, to a croft called Mateuslahti in Heikkilä farm, Pyhältö village.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kustaa's first wife Anna passed away in 1883 and Kustaa soon remarried.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
